WEBVTT

00:00:00.730 --> 00:00:04.850
Thanks to Shoutmon's efforts in his 
training to become the Digimon King,

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:07.300
we managed to defeat Blastmon

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:10.120
and obtain lots of Code Crowns.

00:00:10.790 --> 00:00:14.430
But then I heard a mysterious melody...

00:00:15.590 --> 00:00:16.930
A melody!

00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:19.330
I can hear the melody of a 
Digimon who's about to die!

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:22.430
Where?! Where are you?!

00:00:22.930 --> 00:00:31.460
<b>Sweets Zone!</b>

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:31.460
<b>The Battle of the Sweet Tooth Digimon!</b>

00:00:25.490 --> 00:00:29.180
Sweets Zone! The Battle of 
the Sweet Tooth Digimon!

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:36.720
Is that it?

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:39.220
I'm going to save you.

00:00:48.630 --> 00:00:50.400
Reload!

00:00:57.660 --> 00:00:58.690
What's wrong?

00:00:58.690 --> 00:01:00.600
Leave this to me!

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:02.470
Kizunaol!

00:01:07.430 --> 00:01:08.750
Are you okay?

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:12.680
What in the world happened?

00:01:12.680 --> 00:01:14.590
And who are you, anyway?

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:16.670
My name is Spadamon.

00:01:16.670 --> 00:01:19.670
I'm one of the warriors who 
protects the Sweets Zone.

00:01:20.390 --> 00:01:24.700
But now the Bagra Army has gained 
control of the Sweets Zone.

00:01:24.700 --> 00:01:26.510
What? The Bagra Army?

00:01:26.510 --> 00:01:29.400
Do you guys know a team 
called Xros Heart?

00:01:30.030 --> 00:01:33.990
I heard that if I asked them, 
they could save everyone in the Zone.

00:01:33.990 --> 00:01:35.740
You there, you there...

00:01:35.740 --> 00:01:37.440
Hear and be surprised!

00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:38.710
See and be surprised!

00:01:38.710 --> 00:01:40.750
We who you see before you are...

00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:43.150
Team Xros Heart!

00:01:43.150 --> 00:01:46.530
Really? You don't look strong at all.

00:01:47.890 --> 00:01:49.330
Now, listen!

00:01:49.330 --> 00:01:52.940
They say a skilled hawk hides 
its pointy head, right?

00:01:52.940 --> 00:01:54.920
No, it hides its sharp talons.

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:56.930
And your pointy head 
isn't hidden at all.

00:01:56.930 --> 00:01:59.260
That's beside the point!

00:01:59.260 --> 00:02:01.500
Anyway, if that's the case...

00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:02.500
We can't turn our backs on them.

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:04.380
We must save everyone...

00:02:04.380 --> 00:02:07.310
...in the Sweets Zone 
from the Bagra Army!

00:02:07.810 --> 00:02:08.740
You mean it?!

00:02:08.740 --> 00:02:09.700
Yeah.

00:02:09.700 --> 00:02:12.600
We'll go straight to the Sweets Zone,

00:02:12.600 --> 00:02:16.170
so you can get in my Xros 
Loader with the others.

00:02:17.120 --> 00:02:19.490
Okay, here we go!

00:02:21.220 --> 00:02:22.420
Change Zone!

00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:34.160
Snow made of data?

00:02:34.160 --> 00:02:35.250
Wow!

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:35.530
What is it?

00:02:35.530 --> 00:02:36.770
Look!

00:02:37.340 --> 00:02:39.800
All the buildings in this town have...

00:02:40.150 --> 00:02:41.410
Biscuit roofs!

00:02:41.410 --> 00:02:42.970
Chocolate doors!

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:44.610
Candy chimneys!

00:02:44.610 --> 00:02:46.180
Caramel walls!

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:49.000
It smells so sweet!

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:52.180
It's a whole town made of desserts!

00:02:52.180 --> 00:02:53.990
What are desserts?

00:02:53.990 --> 00:02:56.050
They're foods that are 
sweet and delicious!

00:02:56.050 --> 00:02:59.200
To the girl who was known 
as the sweets master,

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:00.980
it's a real paradise!

00:03:01.450 --> 00:03:03.780
You were known as the sweets master?

00:03:05.140 --> 00:03:06.550
Everyone hide!

00:03:09.600 --> 00:03:10.870
Are they...

00:03:11.240 --> 00:03:12.600
Bagra soldiers.

00:03:19.440 --> 00:03:22.010
But where is everyone?

00:03:22.010 --> 00:03:24.240
Why is there nobody in this town?

00:03:24.240 --> 00:03:26.280
It was Matadormon's doing.

00:03:26.280 --> 00:03:27.760
Matadormon?

00:03:27.760 --> 00:03:28.540
Yes.

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:31.360
The Sweets Zone has always been a home

00:03:31.710 --> 00:03:35.660
to patissiers and sweets-loving Digimon.

00:03:35.660 --> 00:03:37.730
What's a patissier?

00:03:37.730 --> 00:03:40.700
Someone who makes delicious desserts.

00:03:41.100 --> 00:03:44.140
The town was full of sweets 
made by patissiers,

00:03:44.140 --> 00:03:46.300
and everyone lived in peace.

00:03:47.720 --> 00:03:49.970
But then the Bagra Army invaded.

00:03:49.970 --> 00:03:52.980
The town was destroyed, 
and the Code Crown stolen.

00:03:52.980 --> 00:03:55.660
Then, when the extreme sweets lover

00:03:55.660 --> 00:03:57.850
Matadormon became the ruler,

00:03:57.850 --> 00:03:59.900
he locked all the 
patissiers in the castle

00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:02.490
and forced them to make 
his favorite sweets.

00:04:02.490 --> 00:04:05.170
Because of that, my friend was also...

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:07.500
That's terrible.

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:09.150
I can't forgive him!

00:04:09.150 --> 00:04:12.470
And all those who weren't patissiers

00:04:12.470 --> 00:04:14.870
were also taken away somewhere.

00:04:14.870 --> 00:04:18.080
Where is this Matadormon?

00:04:18.080 --> 00:04:22.900
He's very cautious, 
and almost never shows himself.

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:26.040
It's said that only 
patissiers can meet him.

00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:28.630
Anyway, we have to save them.

00:04:28.630 --> 00:04:29.810
Who are you?!

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:35.190
This Zone is under the 
command of the Bagra Army!

00:04:35.690 --> 00:04:37.860
Have you come here knowing that?!

00:04:38.690 --> 00:04:39.970
Guess we'll just...

00:04:39.970 --> 00:04:41.010
...have to fight!

00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:41.840
Wait.

00:04:42.700 --> 00:04:46.930
<i>I don't think these 
guys know who we are.</i>

00:04:47.450 --> 00:04:48.630
<i>So then...</i>

00:04:49.870 --> 00:04:50.800
All right!

00:04:50.800 --> 00:04:53.110
What? What do we do?

00:04:53.110 --> 00:04:55.160
Miss Akari here

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:58.230
is the number one patissier 
in the Digital World!

00:04:58.230 --> 00:04:59.190
What?!

00:05:00.240 --> 00:05:02.050
Akari is a patis—

00:05:03.310 --> 00:05:05.340
Now that you mention it, that's right!

00:05:05.340 --> 00:05:06.350
N-No I'm—

00:05:06.350 --> 00:05:07.670
You should show some respect!

00:05:07.670 --> 00:05:08.490
I'm not!

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:10.890
Bow! Bow before her!

00:05:12.750 --> 00:05:14.460
They're actually bowing...

00:05:14.800 --> 00:05:15.870
All right!

00:05:16.350 --> 00:05:18.990
Miss Akari has come 
to present some of her

00:05:18.990 --> 00:05:20.870
sweets to Master Matadormon.

00:05:20.870 --> 00:05:23.200
H-Hold it!

00:05:24.770 --> 00:05:27.910
This is the Sweets Castle.

00:05:30.510 --> 00:05:33.550
I will inform Master 
Matadormon that you've come.

00:05:33.550 --> 00:05:34.510
You will wait.

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:44.100
What do we do, Taiki?

00:05:44.100 --> 00:05:47.700
Attack Matadormon the 
moment he shows up?

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:50.760
We have to save the patissiers first.

00:05:50.760 --> 00:05:54.460
But we don't know where 
they're being held.

00:05:55.300 --> 00:05:56.380
Monitamon!

00:05:56.380 --> 00:05:58.660
Just leave that to us!

00:05:58.660 --> 00:06:01.420
Miss Nene is already making her move.

00:06:01.420 --> 00:06:04.610
When we save the patissiers, 
we'll report to you.

00:06:04.610 --> 00:06:06.680
We can always count on Nene's crew!

00:06:07.880 --> 00:06:09.680
I have received his answer.

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:11.930
Master Matadormon is angry.

00:06:12.480 --> 00:06:14.550
Because...

00:06:16.250 --> 00:06:18.960
The Bagra Army's number one patissier,

00:06:18.960 --> 00:06:21.460
WaruMonzaemon, is also here!

00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:24.800
If you call yourself number one...

00:06:24.800 --> 00:06:26.330
I never called myself that!

00:06:26.330 --> 00:06:28.100
Then you must have a sweets-making

00:06:28.100 --> 00:06:29.730
battle with WaruMonzaemon!

00:06:29.730 --> 00:06:33.140
A sweets-making battle?!

00:06:33.140 --> 00:06:37.510
If you win, Master Matadormon 
has agreed to meet with you.

00:06:37.510 --> 00:06:40.040
But if you lose...

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:42.000
we'll take your lives!

00:06:43.190 --> 00:06:46.760
For a Sweets Zone, this 
place isn't sweet at all!

00:06:46.760 --> 00:06:48.010
Listen...

00:06:48.620 --> 00:06:51.510
They called me the sweets master,

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:53.430
but I'm only good at eating them.

00:06:55.190 --> 00:06:57.460
I've never made any before.

00:06:57.460 --> 00:06:59.410
What?!

00:06:59.410 --> 00:07:00.230
Not even once?

00:07:00.530 --> 00:07:04.910
I've only helped my mom 
make a banana cake.

00:07:04.910 --> 00:07:08.510
But it was a disaster because of me.

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:17.330
D-Don't worry. We'll all help you.

00:07:17.330 --> 00:07:20.240
This is our chance to 
meet with Matadormon!

00:07:20.240 --> 00:07:22.420
We have to win!

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:23.990
Yeah!

00:07:23.990 --> 00:07:27.930
Akari, do your best to save 
the Sweets Zone, okay?

00:07:30.480 --> 00:07:33.970
All right. I'll try!

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:36.820
I accept your challenge!

00:07:39.810 --> 00:07:43.470
Very well! Open the Kitchen Coliseum!

00:07:49.410 --> 00:07:52.520
That's the whole, giant kitch-en caboodle!

00:07:52.520 --> 00:07:53.800
And that's not all!

00:07:54.800 --> 00:07:57.620
It's not just limited to sweet Digi-foods.

00:07:57.620 --> 00:07:59.610
It also features replicas 
of Master Matadormon's

00:07:59.610 --> 00:08:01.090
favorite ingredients and seasonings,

00:08:01.090 --> 00:08:04.530
made using data from the human world.

00:08:04.530 --> 00:08:06.660
You have one hour.

00:08:06.660 --> 00:08:07.800
Begin!

00:08:08.830 --> 00:08:10.850
So, what will you make?

00:08:10.850 --> 00:08:13.410
I only know one recipe.

00:08:13.410 --> 00:08:14.870
Banana cake!

00:08:15.580 --> 00:08:19.460
Get me strawberries, cherries, 
chocolate, and fresh cream.

00:08:19.460 --> 00:08:20.180
Yes, sir!

00:08:20.180 --> 00:08:21.580
We're gonna go for it, too!

00:08:21.580 --> 00:08:23.180
Yeah!

00:08:23.180 --> 00:08:27.420
Except... aren't these 
ingredients too big?

00:08:27.420 --> 00:08:28.990
For starters, we'll need...

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:34.420
Butter, sugar, eggs, cake flour, 
baking powder, and vanilla extract.

00:08:34.420 --> 00:08:36.600
Okay, let's split up and look for them.

00:08:36.600 --> 00:08:37.960
Thanks!

00:08:38.560 --> 00:08:39.630
What's wrong?

00:08:39.630 --> 00:08:41.950
I forgot about the bananas...

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:43.620
Leave those to us!

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:45.470
Akari, you make the cake.

00:08:45.470 --> 00:08:47.270
Okay, I'm counting on you!

00:08:50.690 --> 00:08:52.480
Miss Nene, look over here.

00:08:57.650 --> 00:09:00.750
Bananas, bananas, bananas...

00:09:01.710 --> 00:09:04.910
I don't even know what 
bananas look like!

00:09:04.910 --> 00:09:06.120
Have you gone bananas?

00:09:06.120 --> 00:09:08.590
Shall I show you?

00:09:08.590 --> 00:09:09.530
Really?

00:09:09.850 --> 00:09:12.150
Sure. They look like this.

00:09:12.150 --> 00:09:15.040
With bananas, see, it's the skins you use.

00:09:15.040 --> 00:09:17.240
Just get rid of the insides by eating them.

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:19.300
Oh! Really?

00:09:19.300 --> 00:09:20.000
Here you go.

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:22.980
This is good!

00:09:22.980 --> 00:09:24.180
Wild!

00:09:24.180 --> 00:09:27.260
There are plenty, so peel them in here.

00:09:28.280 --> 00:09:30.170
Thanks, sir!

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:31.530
Don't mention it.

00:09:33.990 --> 00:09:36.550
Eat them all up.

00:09:38.390 --> 00:09:40.290
<b>Sugar</b>

00:09:38.390 --> 00:09:40.290
<b>Butter</b>

00:09:38.390 --> 00:09:40.290
Let's see... First,

00:09:40.870 --> 00:09:43.230
put the butter and sugar in the bowl...

00:09:43.230 --> 00:09:45.100
and blend until it looks white.

00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:49.680
Then add the eggs and mix well.

00:09:49.680 --> 00:09:52.220
Dorulumon is good at mixing!

00:09:52.220 --> 00:09:53.870
You want me to use my drill?!

00:09:53.870 --> 00:09:55.510
Please?

00:09:57.290 --> 00:09:58.840
J-Just this once.

00:09:58.840 --> 00:10:00.090
Thanks!

00:10:00.090 --> 00:10:01.760
It's gotta be good and clean.

00:10:01.760 --> 00:10:03.980
I think my pride is wounded.

00:10:05.180 --> 00:10:07.250
Dorulu Tornado!

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:08.820
That's the way!

00:10:08.820 --> 00:10:12.180
Next we add the vanilla 
and crushed bananas.

00:10:12.180 --> 00:10:14.110
Hey, we don't have any bananas.

00:10:14.690 --> 00:10:15.680
That's right...

00:10:15.680 --> 00:10:17.900
I asked Shoutmon and 
Ballistamon to get those.

00:10:19.850 --> 00:10:22.120
So full...

00:10:22.120 --> 00:10:23.600
I can't eat any more...

00:11:50.530 --> 00:11:51.390
What's up?

00:11:51.390 --> 00:11:53.580
What are you guys doing?!

00:11:53.580 --> 00:11:55.940
We got the bananas ready.

00:11:55.940 --> 00:11:57.330
You ate them all!

00:11:57.620 --> 00:11:59.800
It's the skins you need, right?

00:11:59.800 --> 00:12:01.740
That's bananas!

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:03.180
You use the insides!

00:12:03.180 --> 00:12:04.130
What?!

00:12:04.130 --> 00:12:06.070
But WaruMonzaemon told us...

00:12:07.010 --> 00:12:08.470
That little...

00:12:08.470 --> 00:12:09.870
He tricked us!

00:12:10.300 --> 00:12:11.280
Forget about it.

00:12:11.280 --> 00:12:14.430
Akari, are there any other 
ingredients you can use?

00:12:14.430 --> 00:12:15.620
Well...

00:12:15.620 --> 00:12:19.150
If I had some other fruits, 
like strawberries or cherries...

00:12:19.150 --> 00:12:21.590
The fruit shelves are empty!

00:12:21.590 --> 00:12:23.820
Those guys took them all!

00:12:24.800 --> 00:12:28.790
I can't help it. I'm gonna need all of them.

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:31.000
That's dirty!

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:32.630
Hey, what about these?

00:12:32.630 --> 00:12:34.830
Huge sweet potatoes!

00:12:34.830 --> 00:12:37.580
Roasted sweet potatoes are my favorite!

00:12:38.240 --> 00:12:39.760
That's it!

00:12:39.760 --> 00:12:43.040
Change of plans: 
We're making a potato cake!

00:12:43.040 --> 00:12:46.830
I'm sure we can make a 
delicious cake with potatoes.

00:12:46.830 --> 00:12:47.350
Really?

00:12:47.650 --> 00:12:51.620
The most important thing for 
making delicious sweets...

00:12:52.170 --> 00:12:53.750
is making them with all your heart,

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:58.720
with a wish that the people 
who eat them will be happy.

00:12:59.680 --> 00:13:04.200
And yet you used such a cowardly 
trick to interfere with my baking!

00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:07.270
I'll never forgive you!

00:13:09.200 --> 00:13:10.600
All right!

00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:13.470
We're gonna make a 
delicious potato cake!

00:13:13.470 --> 00:13:14.810
Yeah!

00:13:15.730 --> 00:13:17.940
First we cut up the potatoes.

00:13:18.330 --> 00:13:20.910
Horn Breaker!

00:13:20.910 --> 00:13:23.820
Rowdy Rocker!

00:13:25.850 --> 00:13:30.570
Then we add the batter 
Dorulumon mixed for us,

00:13:30.570 --> 00:13:31.670
and mix again.

00:13:31.670 --> 00:13:32.620
Right!

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:35.070
I'll do the mixing this time!

00:13:35.070 --> 00:13:36.560
Blue Brave!

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:41.020
Once it's mixed, pour it into that mold.

00:13:42.410 --> 00:13:45.670
Now we just bake it in 
the oven, and it's done!

00:13:45.670 --> 00:13:47.110
There!

00:13:49.570 --> 00:13:51.680
One minute left!

00:13:51.680 --> 00:13:53.070
What?!

00:13:53.070 --> 00:13:55.260
But it won't bake in one minute!

00:13:55.260 --> 00:13:58.920
I'll bake it with my Ultrasonic Wave.

00:13:58.920 --> 00:14:04.080
I am Cu-Cu-Cu-Cu-Cutemon!

00:14:04.080 --> 00:14:08.530
I am Cu-Cu-Cu-Cu-Cutemon!

00:14:08.530 --> 00:14:13.060
I am Cu-Cu-Cu-Cu-Cutemon!

00:14:13.060 --> 00:14:15.600
I am Cu-Cu-Cu-Cu...

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:20.540
Time's up!

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:23.370
Competitors, bring your 
finished cakes forward.

00:14:28.780 --> 00:14:29.860
Water Dragon!

00:14:29.860 --> 00:14:30.650
Fire Shot!

00:14:32.250 --> 00:14:33.750
Who are you?!

00:14:33.750 --> 00:14:34.770
Run! Run!

00:14:35.820 --> 00:14:36.220
Now!

00:14:36.220 --> 00:14:38.060
Random Laser!

00:14:43.760 --> 00:14:44.800
Who are you?

00:14:44.800 --> 00:14:47.920
We've come to save this Zone.

00:14:47.920 --> 00:14:50.170
We are Team Xros Heart.

00:14:50.170 --> 00:14:55.940
And now, at last, I present 
Master Matadormon!

00:14:57.430 --> 00:14:58.910
Everyone,

00:14:58.910 --> 00:15:00.810
thank you for waiting.

00:15:00.810 --> 00:15:01.910
That's Matadormon?

00:15:02.320 --> 00:15:06.700
We will begin with 
WaruMonzaemon's sweets.

00:15:07.320 --> 00:15:09.910
A chocolate cake!

00:15:12.020 --> 00:15:13.690
Enjoy.

00:15:16.720 --> 00:15:18.800
I expected no less of you, 
WaruMonzaemon.

00:15:18.800 --> 00:15:20.400
So delicious, it's almost hateful.

00:15:20.400 --> 00:15:23.230
Next is the patissier Akari's sweets.

00:15:24.730 --> 00:15:27.040
What is this?!

00:15:34.810 --> 00:15:37.730
You losers will experience hell.

00:15:40.150 --> 00:15:41.790
Huge basins!

00:15:41.790 --> 00:15:44.760
Those huge basins will 
fall right on each of your...

00:15:45.720 --> 00:15:47.990
Ouch! Why me?!

00:15:47.990 --> 00:15:50.180
Sweet!

00:15:50.180 --> 00:15:53.700
Your cake was indeed very good, 
but it had no surprises.

00:15:53.700 --> 00:15:57.560
But their cake, in contrast 
with its vile appearance,

00:15:57.560 --> 00:16:02.110
was full of gentle flavor straight 
from the heart of its maker.

00:16:04.640 --> 00:16:08.880
Now, as promised, 
I shall meet with you! Olé!

00:16:09.600 --> 00:16:12.140
So he finally shows his face, huh?

00:16:12.140 --> 00:16:13.450
Master Taiki!

00:16:15.820 --> 00:16:20.120
I've received word that Miss 
Nene has freed the patissiers.

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:23.230
All right! Now we just have 
to find the town's residents!

00:16:24.190 --> 00:16:25.850
Who are you kids?

00:16:25.850 --> 00:16:28.830
We're the ones who are 
gonna change this world.

00:16:28.830 --> 00:16:31.470
The team bound by a bond 
between burning hearts...

00:16:32.540 --> 00:16:34.560
Team Xros Heart!

00:16:35.160 --> 00:16:38.770
You are the wanted Xros Heart?

00:16:38.770 --> 00:16:41.660
Matadormon, where have you 
sent the town's Digimon?

00:16:42.300 --> 00:16:45.160
I know better than to 
answer such questions!

00:16:45.160 --> 00:16:47.450
Thousand Arrow!

00:16:51.320 --> 00:16:56.490
Monzaemon army, unite with 
WaruMonzaemon and seize them!

00:17:08.210 --> 00:17:11.180
We can't get captured here!

00:17:11.180 --> 00:17:11.640
Let's do this!

00:17:25.720 --> 00:17:27.090
Shoutmon!

00:17:27.090 --> 00:17:28.390
Okay!

00:17:28.390 --> 00:17:29.730
Ballistamon!

00:17:30.930 --> 00:17:32.060
Dorulumon!

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:34.370
Starmons!

00:17:34.370 --> 00:17:35.600
Yes!

00:17:36.370 --> 00:17:38.090
DigiXros!

00:17:38.090 --> 00:17:39.850
DigiXros!

00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:43.820
Shoutmon X4!

00:17:54.450 --> 00:17:57.070
Heartbreak Attack!

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:09.470
Burning Star Cr—

00:18:12.370 --> 00:18:13.590
This is too dangerous!

00:18:13.840 --> 00:18:15.830
Having only the Star 
Sword against an enemy

00:18:15.830 --> 00:18:18.310
with a weapon in both 
hands is a disadvantage!

00:18:18.310 --> 00:18:19.680
Taiki...

00:18:19.680 --> 00:18:23.780
I want to help the ones who 
are fighting to save us!

00:18:23.780 --> 00:18:25.920
Let me fight with them!

00:18:25.920 --> 00:18:27.020
Spadamon...

00:18:27.020 --> 00:18:28.550
Please!

00:18:29.690 --> 00:18:31.210
Okay, then!

00:18:31.960 --> 00:18:33.870
Let's fight him together!

00:18:34.330 --> 00:18:35.990
Shoutmon X4!

00:18:35.990 --> 00:18:37.170
Okay!

00:18:37.170 --> 00:18:38.700
Spadamon!

00:18:39.500 --> 00:18:41.070
DigiXros!

00:18:45.690 --> 00:18:48.340
Shoutmon X4S!

00:18:54.450 --> 00:18:56.180
That's it, X4S!

00:18:57.280 --> 00:19:00.080
Then I'll power up, too!

00:19:00.080 --> 00:19:03.520
I'll show you the bond of 
burning hearts that connects us!

00:19:03.790 --> 00:19:06.240
Giga Heartbreak Attack!

00:19:06.240 --> 00:19:08.710
Victory Brave!

00:19:16.300 --> 00:19:18.280
He was strong.

00:19:18.280 --> 00:19:19.600
You did it.

00:19:19.910 --> 00:19:20.740
Nene!

00:19:21.050 --> 00:19:23.570
All the patissiers are safe.

00:19:23.570 --> 00:19:25.310
Thank you, Xros Heart.

00:19:25.790 --> 00:19:27.410
I'm glad you're okay.

00:19:27.410 --> 00:19:31.430
Xros Heart has defeated Blastmon,

00:19:31.430 --> 00:19:35.420
and now they're attempting to steal 
the Sweets Zone's Code Crown.

00:19:35.840 --> 00:19:39.990
They have already taken the lead 
in the battle for the Code Crowns.

00:19:40.330 --> 00:19:42.020
Shall I send reinforcements?

00:19:42.020 --> 00:19:45.340
Matadormon is a formidable fighter,

00:19:45.340 --> 00:19:49.450
and I will soon revive the 
ultimate destructive Digimon.

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:51.440
We will entrust this to them.

00:19:51.440 --> 00:19:52.000
Yes, sir.

00:19:52.690 --> 00:19:55.800
But in the event that 
they are defeated...

00:19:55.800 --> 00:20:00.580
The perfect me will hammer down 
the nail that dares to stick up.

00:20:00.580 --> 00:20:03.510
It was you who brought Xros Heart here?

00:20:03.510 --> 00:20:05.620
Yes. Sorry I was late.

00:20:05.920 --> 00:20:08.480
Not at all. You really saved us.

00:20:10.500 --> 00:20:11.310
What's wrong?

00:20:11.990 --> 00:20:14.120
Could you be... Cutemon?

00:20:14.120 --> 00:20:16.130
Huh? You know me?

00:20:16.130 --> 00:20:20.810
I saw the Bagra Army 
bring your parents here.

00:20:21.230 --> 00:20:22.730
You saw my mom and dad?!

00:20:22.730 --> 00:20:27.110
But they defied Matadormon, 
and were thrown into the abyss.

00:20:27.840 --> 00:20:31.650
So Cutemon's parents 
are still down there?

00:20:31.650 --> 00:20:32.410
You think maybe...

00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:35.810
all the town's Digimon are down there, too?

00:20:35.810 --> 00:20:37.830
So half-baked!

00:20:38.580 --> 00:20:40.370
Butterfly Breaking Trumpet Kick!

00:20:43.490 --> 00:20:44.320
Miss Nene!

00:20:52.930 --> 00:20:54.680
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:20:54.680 --> 00:20:58.200
<b>Digimon Data Collection</b>

00:20:55.410 --> 00:20:58.200
Digimon Data Collection!

00:20:58.200 --> 00:21:02.140
<b>Listen to the Digimon's melody!</b>

00:20:58.200 --> 00:21:02.140
Listen to the melody of 
this Digimon I caught!

00:20:59.150 --> 00:21:00.160
<b>Melody starts in 3 seconds.</b>

00:21:00.160 --> 00:21:01.160
<b>Melody starts in 2 seconds.</b>

00:21:01.160 --> 00:21:02.140
<b>Melody starts in 1 second.</b>

00:21:04.880 --> 00:21:14.550
<b>[Type]</b>

00:21:07.110 --> 00:21:14.550
<b>Dragon Type</b>

00:21:07.880 --> 00:21:14.550
<b>[Attacks]</b>

00:21:09.350 --> 00:21:14.550
<b>Baby Breath
Tail Smash
G Shurunen</b>

00:21:11.190 --> 00:21:14.550
It's small, but it's still a dragon!

00:21:16.420 --> 00:21:20.020
A nasty Digimon is about to be born 
underground in the Sweets Zone!

00:21:20.020 --> 00:21:22.210
Shoutmon! Cutemon's parents are...

00:21:22.210 --> 00:21:23.190
Mom! Dad!

00:21:23.190 --> 00:21:25.700
I promise I'll save you 
with my own strength!

00:21:25.700 --> 00:21:27.350
Digimon Xros Wars!

00:21:27.350 --> 00:21:29.380
<b>Ultimate Weapon Activated!</b>

00:21:27.350 --> 00:21:29.380
<b>You Can Do It, Cutemon!</b>

00:21:27.350 --> 00:21:29.430
You can't turn your back 
on the next one, either!
